model: A general integer model. variables: [{name, type: "integer" (needs lb and ub, the largest sensible value) or "boolean"}]. constraints: [{name in plain words, terms: {variable: coefficient}, sense: "<="|">="|"==", rhs}]. objective: {sense: "minimize"|"maximize", terms: {variable: coefficient}}. Decimals are fine.
Example: {"variables": [{"name": "x", "type": "integer", "lb": 0, "ub": 50}, {"name": "y", "type": "integer", "lb": 0, "ub": 50}], "constraints": [{"name": "wood", "terms": {"x": 2, "y": 5}, "sense": "<=", "rhs": 200}], "objective": {"sense": "maximize", "terms": {"x": 30, "y": 80}}}
Returns objective and values (zeros left out).

